# Audited: Go's entry, Id (through the record's field) and Grow are the three cycles (the two lambdas are not entered by the agreed count); Run gives K the 4 Wrap closed over, and Grow 4 = 5.
# The pipe's tests: declarations of be-pipe-record.prism (Semantics chapter 6).

test the_pipe_runs, @Piped 4:
    build
    compute until idle
        => expect Ui.Label(text="5")
